  "details": "I'd love to see the EditorBrowsableAttribute added to SDK items for public items. MS Visual Studio, JB ReSharper and JB Rider all look at this attribute to (optionally) filter members when performing intellisense. It'd make developing udon scripts much faster. It'd basically be a matter of adding a second attribute to the existing ExcludeFromUdonWrapper attribute on these methods.\n\nRelevant class: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.componentmodel.editorbrowsableattribute?view=net-8.0 (this is available back in .net framework 1.1)",
